    "name": "Mops & Mobs: A Sweeping Dungeon Novel",
    "steam_appid": 2851050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/0a484df2d96558005fafdb23bab0d04f.avif?t=1753622747\" width=600 height=326 /></span><br><br>Welcome to your new job! As the dungeon's janitor you take care of our monsters' well-being, pick up adventurers' left-over limbs, decorate the dungeon and find ways to let our beloved Dungeon Master look more competent.<br><br>In this Visual Novel slash Dungeon Crawler slash Room Decoration Simulator you will find new friends, a purpose, and maybe ... *the artifact*?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Interactive environment and NPCs<br></li><li> All original IP and story<br></li><li> Non-linear story-telling with a love for lore in a semi-open world<br></li><li> Gritty retro look and feel<br></li><li> Decorate rooms to your and the monsters' liking with nice furniture</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/faab6a9e9718bbcbfcd88569788c1123.avif?t=1753622747\" width=600 height=240 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/0a484df2d96558005fafdb23bab0d04f.avif?t=1753622747\" width=600 height=326 /></span><br><br>Welcome to your new job! As the dungeon's janitor you take care of our monsters' well-being, pick up adventurers' left-over limbs, decorate the dungeon and find ways to let our beloved Dungeon Master look more competent.<br><br>In this Visual Novel slash Dungeon Crawler slash Room Decoration Simulator you will find new friends, a purpose, and maybe ... *the artifact*?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Interactive environment and NPCs<br></li><li> All original IP and story<br></li><li> Non-linear story-telling with a love for lore in a semi-open world<br></li><li> Gritty retro look and feel<br></li><li> Decorate rooms to your and the monsters' liking with nice furniture</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/faab6a9e9718bbcbfcd88569788c1123.avif?t=1753622747\" width=600 height=240 /></span>",
